<title>USA: Delaware Group replaces funds' co-manager.</title>
<headline>Delaware Group replaces funds' co-manager.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delaware Group Dividend &amp; Income Fund and Delaware Global and Dividend &amp; Income Fund said Babak Zenouzi will replace Bernard Schaeffer as co-manager of both funds.</p>
<p>The funds other co-managers will remain the same, the company said.</p>
<p>Zenouzi has been involved with both funds since their inception, the company added.</p>
</text>
